  "prerouter": {
    "notes": [
      "Edge0 c7ee73d docs/prerouter.md: the head owned by layer N reads concat[layer N MoE input, current-token top-k one-hot, previous-token top-k one-hot] and predicts layer N+1 routing for the next token; head = fc1 -> erf GELU -> fc2, plus linear_init. Owners run from first_owner to n_layer - 2.",
      "Payload is the unchanged F16 safetensors data; GGML shape order reverses the safetensors [out, in] shape."
    ],
